# An album page: songs on the left, the cover and its details on the right, Play album and Shuffle.
Output docs/album.gif
Source tapes/style.tape

Hide
Type "tapes/demo.sh"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Show

Sleep 1s
Type "/"
Sleep 300ms
Type "rumours fleetwood mac"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
# the Albums tab: the album is the first one
Right
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 4s
# Shuffle
Down
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 6s
# the songs
Down@300ms 4
Sleep 3s

Hide
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
